{"id":"0592a2b3124532a9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-orthterm.md","title":"Orthogonal terms","display":"df-orthterm — Orthogonal terms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-orthterm","aliases":["27-df-orthterm"],"display":"df-orthterm — Orthogonal terms","depends_on":["[[27-df-litset]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-orthterm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-orthterm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthterm — Orthogonal terms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i,\\bar x_i\">\\(x_i,\\bar x_i\\)</span> 的项与文字接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthTerm}\\)</span> 是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 后在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> 上引入的二元谓词定义目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U)\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,((x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U))\\lor(\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U)\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,((x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U))\\lor(\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.1，印刷页 327，PDF 第 351 页（从 1 计数）。两个一致项的真点子立方体不交，当且仅当它们在某个变量上指定相反值。若不存在相反文字，则两文字集的并仍一致，可扩充为同时满足两项的赋值，给出反向。n=0 时没有正交项对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n$；$\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)$ 以及 $x_i,\\bar x_i$ 的项与文字接口见 [[27-df-litset]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{OrthTerm}$ 是固定 $n$ 后在 $\\mathrm{Term}_n$ 上引入的二元谓词定义目标。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)","display":false},{"tex":"x_i,\\bar x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U)\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,((x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U))\\lor(\\bar{x}_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\land x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)))","display":true}],"bytes":1216,"backlinks":[{"id":"5db086b596a0f700","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 为 [[27-df-dnf]] 的有限项集族，$\\mathrm{OrthTerm}$ 为 [[27-df-orthterm]] 的二元项谓词。$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 是本节引入的 DNF 子族定义目标。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-orthterm|df-orthterm — Orthogonal terms]]"}],"outgoing":["8311e93eaac6c631"]}